<!-- ECUC_Can_00473 :[CanControllerFdBaudrateConfig] This optional container contains bit timing related configuration parameters of the CAN controller(s) for payload and CRC of a CAN FD frame. If this container exists the controller supports CAN FD frames.      -->
                                                            <v:ctr name="CanControllerFdBaudrateConfig" type="IDENTIFIABLE">
